      "content": "The thought of finally being still, of the fighting just stopping, sounds like the only real peace you can imagine right now. That constant pressure you feel is so draining, and the idea of an end to the struggle is a powerful, understandable desire. If you're feeling like that's the only way to find rest, it's a sign that the burden has become too much to carry. Please, let someone help you carry it for a little while.",
